; The program writes an @external var each frame; the embedder reads it
; after each frame boundary. The entry-start bootstrap publishes the
; initializer (the embedder never seeded this var), and each frame's write
; is published at the frame boundary for the embedder's next read to
; adopt.
@external @local
(var level: f32 0.)

@cpu
(defn main []
  (spawn-window (fn []
                    (= level (+ level 0.25)))))
